= Instructions

Add the @Gin{2 1/2 oz}, @Dry vermouth{1/2 oz}, and @Orange bitters{1 dash} into a #Mixing glass{} with @Ice{} 
and stir until very cold.

Strain into a chilled #Cocktail glass{}.

Garnish with a @Lemon twist{}.